GET http://127.0.0.1:8099/users/1 200 (6 ms) Then 200 And response == { id: 1, name: 'Ada', role: 'admin' }

* baseUrl Given 'users' And { name: 'Grace', role: 'user' } And Content-Type = 'application/json' When post request: 1 > POST http://127.0.0.1:8099/users 1 > Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8 1 > Host: 127.0.0.1:8099 1 > Content-Length: 30 1 > Connection: keep-alive 1 > User-Agent: Apache-HttpClient/5.6.5 (Java/21.0.13) { "name": "Grace", "role": "user" }
response time in milliseconds: 6 1 < 201 POST http://127.0.0.1:8099/users 1 < content-length: 37 1 < X-Request-Id: req-123 1 < vary: origin 1 < Karate-Mock: true 1 < Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8 { "name": "Grace", "role": "user", "id": 3 }
POST http://127.0.0.1:8099/users 201 (6 ms) Then 201 And response.id == '#number' And responseHeaders['X-Request-Id'][0] == 'req-123'

